1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,420
凌晨三点，演员吴越发了一条很生气的微博：
3 a.m.: actress Wu Yue posts an angry message.

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,350
视频里那个卖护肤品的“我”，不是我！
The 'me' selling skincare in that video is not me!

3
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:10,010
脸是她的，声音也像她的，可全是AI做的。
Her face, her voice, almost. All made by AI.

4
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:14,480
视频里的“她”还说：这个产品不是他们找我，是我找他们。
The fake her even says: they didn't come to me, I went to them.

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,890
今天的问题：AI是怎么偷走一张脸的？
Today's question: how does AI steal a face?

6
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,520
你又该怎么识破？
And how do you catch it?

7
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:24,600
再烧一点：连明星本人都很难证明“我是我”，我们普通人看什么？
Harder one: if even a star can't prove she's herself, what do the rest of us look at?

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,270
先认识今天的主角：小画，一个AI画像师。
Meet our star: Doodle, an AI portrait painter.

9
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:31,980
小画干活分两步。第一步：看你的脸，只记笔记。
Doodle works in two steps. Step one: look at a face, and only take notes.

10
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,590
笔记上没有长相，只有几个数：
The notes have no looks, just numbers:

11
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:38,070
嘴角翘多少，头往哪边转，眼睛眨没眨。
how much you smile, which way you turn, whether you blink.

12
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:42,630
第二步：拿着这份笔记，照另一个人的样子，重新画一张脸。
Step two: take those notes and redraw them as somebody else's face.

13
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:45,010
这就是换脸：主播在镜头前笑，
That's a face swap. The streamer smiles on camera,

14
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:47,500
小画就画出一个“吴越”在笑。
and Doodle paints a 'Wu Yue' smiling.

15
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:52,320
打个比方：同一份舞谱，交给两个舞者，跳出来是两个人。
Think of a dance score: same steps, two dancers, two different people.

16
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,490
声音也一样。常见的说法是：
Voices work the same way. A common claim:

17
00:00:54,490 --> 00:00:57,440
几十秒录音，就能学会一个人的音色。
a few dozen seconds of audio is enough to copy one.

18
00:00:57,440 --> 00:01:00,140
而且据报道，大约一千二百八十元，
And reportedly, about 1,280 yuan

19
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:02,120
就能在直播里实时换脸。
buys you a live face swap during a stream.

20
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:05,620
反转一：这么便宜，被冒充的就不止吴越。
Twist one: that cheap, and it's not just Wu Yue.

21
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:09,260
同一个视频的结尾，还冒出了邓亚萍在“带货”。
The same video ends with table tennis legend Deng Yaping 'selling' stuff too.

22
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:13,800
演员温峥嵘也遇到过AI盗播，她说：我很难证明我是我。
Actress Wen Zhengrong hit AI copycats too. She said: it's hard to prove I am me.

23
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,930
那小画有没有画不好的地方？有，下面是常见破绽。
So does Doodle ever mess up? Yes. Here are common tells.

24
00:01:17,930 --> 00:01:21,900
破绽一：让人侧过脸。小画多半是看正脸学的，
Tell one: turn sideways. Doodle mostly learned from front faces.

25
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:24,090
转到九十度，脸容易糊。
At ninety degrees, the face can smear.

26
00:01:24,090 --> 00:01:29,820
破绽二：用手在脸前挡一下。手和脸叠在一起，小画常常画穿帮。
Tell two: wave a hand in front of the face. Hand plus face often breaks the painting.

27
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:34,800
破绽三：看牙齿、眼镜边、耳环。细节越多，越容易出错。
Tell three: teeth, glasses rims, earrings. More detail, more mistakes.

28
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:38,040
破绽四：光从左边来，影子也在左边。
Tell four: light from the left, shadow also on the left.

29
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,640
光影对不上，就要多个心眼。
If light and shadow disagree, be suspicious.

30
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:43,380
破绽五：嘴型和声音，对不齐。
Tell five: lips and voice out of sync.

31
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:47,800
反转二，最反直觉：这些破绽，正在一个一个被补上。
Twist two, the weird one: these tells are being fixed, one by one.

32
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,770
AI一年比一年画得好。
AI paints better every year.

33
00:01:49,770 --> 00:01:52,940
靠眼睛找破绽，就像跟魔术师比手快。
Spotting tells by eye is like out-speeding a magician.

34
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:56,310
所以，最靠得住的不是看脸，是看渠道。
So the safest check isn't the face. It's the channel.

35
00:01:56,310 --> 00:02:00,030
看账号：有没有官方认证，是不是本人的号。
Check the account: is it verified, is it really hers?

36
00:02:00,030 --> 00:02:03,910
看话术：“今天最后一天”，“只剩最后几单”。
Check the pitch: 'last day!', 'only a few left!'

37
00:02:03,910 --> 00:02:05,980
它在催你，你就慢一点。
When it rushes you, slow down.

38
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:09,180
看付款：叫你私下转账的，一律不信。
Check the payment: anyone asking for a private transfer, no.

39
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:14,400
还有一条规矩：从二零二五年九月一日起，AI生成的内容必须加标识。
One more rule: since September 1, 2025, China requires AI-made content to be labeled.

40
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:17,810
这次的视频下面也写了“含AI生成内容”，
This video did say 'contains AI content',

41
00:02:17,810 --> 00:02:19,810
只是字很小，很不显眼。
in tiny, easy-to-miss print.

42
00:02:19,810 --> 00:02:22,550
所以刷视频时，多看一眼角落。
So when you scroll, glance at the corners.

43
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:26,240
后来，涉事账号已被永久封禁，内容清空。
The account has since been banned for good, its videos wiped.

44
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:29,520
友情提示：哪个破绽管用，因视频而异。
Friendly fine print: which tells work varies by video.

45
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:32,910
今天说的是常见情况，不是万能检测法。
These are common cases, not a magic detector.

46
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:35,670
回到开头：明星怎么证明我是我？
Back to the start: how does a star prove she's herself?

47
00:02:35,670 --> 00:02:38,440
答案是：不用证明脸，要证明渠道。
Answer: don't prove the face, prove the channel.

48
00:02:38,440 --> 00:02:41,150
真吴越，在她自己认证的账号里。
The real Wu Yue lives on her own verified account.

49
00:02:41,150 --> 00:02:43,650
小画说：我能画出任何一张脸，
Doodle says: I can paint any face.

50
00:02:43,650 --> 00:02:45,780
可我登不上你的账号。
I just can't log into your account.

